Package: nvc
Type: Package
Title: Nonlinear Coherence for Vector Time Series: Defining Region-to-Region Functional Brain Connectivity
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Paolo", "Redondo", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "p.redondo@lancaster.ac.uk")
Description: Estimates rank-based dependence measures and nonlinear vector
    coherence from block periodograms of multivariate time series. Includes
    permutation tests, comparisons with linear and Kendall-based coherence,
    bandpass filtering, simulation, and EEG connectivity visualization.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: RANN, gtools, LSTS, signal, pcaPP, igraph, parallel, stats,
    graphics, grDevices
NeedsCompilation: no
